# The Feel page (the SEQ button's seventh page, after Steps): the genre's ghost notes, how much the accents and ghosts count (50 as marked), and a
# little looseness; its third knob is empty since 0.17.82. The pad's comping rhythm (auto, hold, off-beat .. eighths) is on the Pad's Chords page
# (ENV x4, view 4) now, in the third place; the pad's chorus moved to the CHORUS settings page.
seed 0
wait 3000
turn SELECT 27 100
expect view 27
expect par161 0
expect par162 50
spin K1 40
wait 100
expect par161 40
spin K2 10
wait 100
expect par162 60
spin K3 2
wait 100
expect par160 0
spin K4 30
wait 100
expect par163 30
shot feel.png
turn SELECT -23 100
expect view 4
spin K3 2
wait 100
expect par160 2
shot chords_comp.png
spin K3 20
wait 100
expect par160 8
